"<x-ncdialog name="Object Vectorization" size="large" data-on="onClosing">
  <slot-actions>
    <x-ncbutton data-on="onClick">
      <slot-default>Cancel</slot-default>
    </x-ncbutton>
    <x-ncbutton variant="primary" disabled="false" data-on="onClick">
      <slot-icon>
        <x-contentsave size="20"></x-contentsave>
      </slot-icon>
      <slot-default> Save Configuration</slot-default>
    </x-ncbutton>
  </slot-actions>
  <slot-default>
    <div class="object-config-content">
      <div class="info-box">
        <x-informationoutline size="20"></x-informationoutline>
        <p>Configure how database objects are converted into vector embeddings for semantic search. Objects are directly vectorized without needing text extraction.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="info-box warning">
        <x-alertcircle size="20"></x-alertcircle>
        <div><strong>Prerequisites</strong>
          <p>Before object vectorization can work:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>LLM must be enabled with an embedding provider configured</li>
            <li>Objects will be serialized as JSON text before vectorization</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="config-section">
        <h3>🔢 Vectorization Settings</h3>
        <div class="form-group">
          <x-nccheckboxradioswitch modelvalue="true" type="switch" data-on="onUpdate:modelValue">
            <slot-default>Enable automatic object vectorization</slot-default>
          </x-nccheckboxradioswitch><small>Automatically generate vector embeddings when objects are created or updated</small>
        </div>
        <div class="trigger-settings">
          <h4>Vectorization Triggers</h4>
          <div class="form-group">
            <x-nccheckboxradioswitch modelvalue="true" type="switch" data-on="onUpdate:modelValue">
              <slot-default>Vectorize on object creation</slot-default>
            </x-nccheckboxradioswitch><small>Generate vectors immediately when new objects are created</small>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <x-nccheckboxradioswitch modelvalue="false" type="switch" data-on="onUpdate:modelValue">
              <slot-default>Re-vectorize on object update</slot-default>
            </x-nccheckboxradioswitch><small>Update vectors when object data changes (recommended for accurate search)</small>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="config-section">
        <h3>💰 View Selection (Cost Optimization)</h3>
        <p class="section-description">Control which object views should be vectorized to reduce API costs. Only vectorize views that benefit from semantic search.</p>
        <div class="form-group">
          <x-nccheckboxradioswitch modelvalue="true" type="switch" data-on="onUpdate:modelValue">
            <slot-default>Vectorize all views</slot-default>
          </x-nccheckboxradioswitch><small>Enable vectorization for all existing and future views (may increase costs)</small>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="config-section">
        <h3>📄 Object Serialization</h3>
        <p class="section-description">Configure how objects are converted to text before vectorization. These settings affect search quality and context.</p>
        <div class="form-group">
          <x-nccheckboxradioswitch modelvalue="true" type="switch" data-on="onUpdate:modelValue">
            <slot-default>Include schema and register metadata</slot-default>
          </x-nccheckboxradioswitch><small>Add schema titles, descriptions, and register information to provide richer context for search</small>
        </div>
        <div class="form-group"><label for="max-depth">Maximum Nesting Depth</label><input id="max-depth" type="number" min="1" max="20" class="input-field"><small>How deep to traverse nested object properties (1-20). Higher values capture more detail but increase vector size.</small></div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <x-nccheckboxradioswitch modelvalue="true" type="switch" data-on="onUpdate:modelValue">
            <slot-default>Include related object references</slot-default>
          </x-nccheckboxradioswitch><small>Include ids and names of related objects for better contextual search</small>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="config-section">
        <h3>⚡ Batch Processing</h3>
        <div class="form-group"><label for="batch-size">Batch Size</label><input id="batch-size" type="number" min="1" max="100" step="1" class="input-field"><small>Number of objects to vectorize in one API call. Higher = faster but more memory. Recommended: 10-50.</small></div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <x-nccheckboxradioswitch modelvalue="true" type="switch" data-on="onUpdate:modelValue">
            <slot-default>Auto-retry failed vectorizations</slot-default>
          </x-nccheckboxradioswitch><small>Automatically retry failed vectorization attempts (max 3 retries)</small>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="config-section">
        <h3>ℹ️ current configuration</h3>
        <div class="info-grid">
          <div class="info-item"><span class="info-label">Embedding Provider</span><span class="info-value">Not configured</span></div>
          <div class="info-item"><span class="info-label">Embedding Model</span><span class="info-value">Not configured</span></div>
          <div class="info-item"><span class="info-label">Vector Dimensions</span><span class="info-value">N/A</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-note"><small>To change the embedding provider or model, go to LLM configuration.</small></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </slot-default>
</x-ncdialog>"
`;

